    "<div style=\"left:-0.484375px;top:0px;height:18px;line-height:18px;\">",
    "further back, Shift+Q one forward, letting go of Alt shows the one chosen, and Escape with Alt still held keeps the tab </div>",
    "</div>",
    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:36px;width:683.6406px;height:18px;font:normal 400 14px Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;color:rgba(141,153,174,1);\">",
    "<div style=\"left:0.390625px;top:0px;height:18px;line-height:18px;\">",
    "you were on. The dock binds no key to this itself; the demo binds Alt+Q where a desktop binds Alt+Tab.</div>",
